                      <div class="fb-post__content__text">
                        <p>Sharing in case it helps another parent:<br/><br/>I ordered the Master 155 pcs as a “big gift” for my two kids (6 and 8) and it’s actually become our weekend activity. They build tall tracks together, argue a bit 😂 then figure it out and high-five when the car makes the whole run.<br/><br/>I like that the pieces feel sturdy and safe, and everything works across the different layouts they invent. We’ve had it for over a month and it’s still out in the living room, not in a box in the closet.</p>
